%% Source of truth: docs/concepts/wallet-model.mdx, "What createAction Can Return".
%% No classDefs on purpose: WriteDocs themes Mermaid itself and redraws it on light/dark switch.
flowchart TD
    call["Your app calls createAction"] --> q{"Can the wallet fund,<br/>sign and process it alone?"}
    q -- Yes --> immediate["Immediate action:<br/>txid and/or the transaction"]
    q -- No --> signable["Signable action:<br/>signableTransaction { tx, reference }"]
    signable --> sign["Your app signs its inputs"]
    sign --> signAction["Your app calls signAction"]
    signAction --> done["Wallet finishes the transaction"]
